  <section class="pillar-introduction" aria-labelledby="stories-introduction-heading">
    <div><p class="kicker">Human stories</p><h2 id="stories-introduction-heading">People, work, and everyday life in Wuyishan.</h2></div>
    <div><p>I’m gathering real interviews and local stories about people whose lives are connected with Wuyishan. Each piece will be published after its facts are checked and the people involved have given permission.</p><aside class="stories-status" role="status"><strong>Work in progress</strong><span>The section is open while the first stories move through review.</span></aside></div>
  </section>
  <div class="pillar-sections stories-structure" aria-label="Planned story formats">
    <PillarSection id="people-and-interviews" title="People" introduction="Conversations with tea makers, villagers, local workers, researchers, and families." />
    <PillarSection id="local-stories" title="Local Stories" introduction="Firsthand stories grounded in a specific person, place, and context." />
    <PillarSection id="story-videos" title="Videos" introduction="Interviews and place-based visual stories with the same fact-checking and permission standards." />
  </div>
</PillarLayout>
